        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John Calvin, Geert Booij, Theodore Beza, Jacobus Arminius\n- Organizations: Leiden University\n- Topics: Calvinist–Arminian debate\n\nFacts:\n- John Calvin's followers were one side in the Calvinist–Arminian debate.\n- Geert Booij is emeritus professor of linguistics at Leiden University.\n- Theodore Beza was a teacher of Jacobus Arminius.\n- Jacobus Arminius was a professor of theology at Leiden University.\n- Jacobus Arminius and the followers of John Calvin were the opposing sides in the history of the Calvinist–Arminian debate.",
